                                "sense_id": "adb6c9cc-5faf-30bc-b1f2-5f92bb00db51",
                                "text": "Court. You heard nothing but a ſtroke fall upon the man? No, nothing elſe ; the laſt ſtroke made more ringling than the reſt ; the two firſt ſounded hollow, as if they were upon the bed cloaths."
