                                "sense_id": "adb6c9cc-5faf-30bc-b1f2-5f92bb00db51",
                                "text": "It is this:—After the descending weight may have unlocked the trap, and it has “ gone off,” that there will not be sufficient power in the mechanism of the bell to keep up a continued ringling for any time; it cannot possibly make any more noise than the quick ring of an ordinary bell, and therefore will not answer the purpose of your alarmists."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8215a10a-26df-47ec-be01-eabb8f11b9eb",
                                "sense_id": "adb6c9cc-5faf-30bc-b1f2-5f92bb00db51",
                                "text": "The intensely Irish character of the air stimulated me to endeavour that the words should partake of that quality, and the rapid replication of the musical phrases made me strive after as rapid a ringling of rhyme, of which our early bards were so fond, […]"
